om2 diag bce
note bce fixture kgt: K 65 > len 64, so the check of get a i is kept and the last pass traps 3 (exit 103).
note A compiler that drops the K <= len test reads b[0] (200) and exits 2216 mod 256 = 168 instead.
global a ulong 64
global b ulong 64
fn main to int
for i ulong 64
put a i i
put b i 200
end
s = ulong 0
for i ulong 65
s = add s get a i
end
ret int rem s 256
end
